<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 318 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 318 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to May 15 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to May 7:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 58,945	58,628</p>
<p> Money market intervention    14,785	16,295</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,908	 1,904</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,912	 1,917</p>
<p> Other				 6,622	 6,791</p>
<p> Total assets		     84,172	85,535</p>
<p>In the previous week, to May 7, reserves fell by 148 million markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
